msgctxt "80"
msgid "Take care of yourself, Kazuki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Same to you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Will do. See you later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Hey, Kazuki. How are you feeling?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kiryu-san! Did you come all the way here just to see me?\r\n"
"The doc says it'll still be a while until I can go home, but\r\n"
"I'm on the mend at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Right. You're looking pretty healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Thanks. Means a lot coming from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Um, Uncle Kazuki? We're actually here to say goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "...Goodbye? Are you two going somewhere, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Yup. The Go-Ryu and the Jingweon have been dealt with,\r\n"
"and Daigo's come around to being the next chairman. My job\r\n"
"here is done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "We're moving to Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Okinawa, huh? That's pretty far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's... kinda the point. Haruka and I are gonna be\r\n"
"running an orphanage down there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Wow. I can't say we won't miss you, Kiryu-san... but I'm\r\n"
"sure you'll be great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Heh, Yuya said pretty much the same thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Oh, he also said you'd come visit us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"We have been looking for places to take the boys for some\r\n"
"team building. Can't think of a better place than Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "You better not forget!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Don't worry, Haruka-chan. We'll visit you soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Thank you for everything. I owe you my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Don't be ridiculous. If it wasn't for me and the Tojo Clan,\r\n"
"you never would have ended up like this in the first place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I hope you can forgive me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Don't be like that, Kiryu-san. I can't imagine a Kamurocho\r\n"
"without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"This town owes you and Kazama-san more than you realize...\r\n"
"so please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "There's no need to apologize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "...If you say so. Thanks again, Kazuki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Of course. And... take care of yourself, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Feel better soon, Uncle Kazuki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Thanks, Haruka-chan. Be good down in Okinawa, okay? I don't want to hear "
"about you getting into any trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Hehe, okay! Bye!"
msgstr ""

